{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなぴょんブログのマイマイへの思いが凄く強すぎてひなぴょんは女が好きなのか！っと一瞬疑ってしまったよ......。(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな皆大好きな聖母マイマイとっ ♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/0000.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みおなちゃん,きぃちゃん,ろってぃ,まあや,と遊んだ時の事......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春のPON！祭りが終わって帰りの車の中で、\n最初はろってぃとまあやで、\nきぃちゃんと、みおなちゃんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川村\n『まあやの家の前にナタデココ並べてあるよね〜♪』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田\n『そうだよ！沢山並べてるんだけどその中にたった１個！\nたった１個だけ......杏仁豆腐が紛れてるんよ......』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀&北野\n『爆笑......』\nとか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田\n『ろってぃそういえば新しいフンドシかった？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川村\n『まだ買いに行く時間なくて買えてない......笑』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野\n『え？フンドシ！？(真顔)』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田\n『え？そうだよ？ろってぃ家にいる時は年中無休フンドシに\n五本指ソックスだよ？\n(もうこのとき笑いこらえれなくて最強に笑いながら話してました)』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しく会話してました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でももちろんこの話は全部嘘です！笑\n完全に信じきってました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかして皆さんも信じちゃった？笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも嘘だよって言ったらまた笑ってくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂はなんでも信じちゃうから、\n以前まいやんとさゆりんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ろってぃの家のお風呂にミラーボールあるんだよ☆』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言った時、信じちゃって、最近嘘だと伝えたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『え！？うそなの？？！！わぁぁぁろってぃならやりそうだから信じちゃったぁ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってました(^w^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まって、ちょっと話それてしまった......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁそんなこんなで車の中で\n楽しい会話から怖い話に変わって\n話してたら堀ちゃんがあまりにも怖くなって、一人で家に居れないって言い出し......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親に泣きながら今すぐ家に来て\nって言い出しちゃって......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはダメだ本当に怖がってる\nって思って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖い話をした川村、和田、北野は罪悪感でいっぱいで......\nとりあえず堀ちゃんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田\n『まあや家きて面白いTVでも見る？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ったんだけど、\nなんだかんだ堀ちゃん家に盛り塩作りに行くことになっちゃって、\n皆でコンビニに塩を買いに行きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもついでに皆とお菓子とかも沢山かって夜映画見ながらお菓子食べました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから盛り塩作るのに堀ちゃんがまさかの大皿出してきたから\nめっちゃ大きい盛り塩作りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀ちゃんらしいよ......(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これで堀ちゃんはもう大丈夫\nと言ってくれたので良かったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9時間くらいワーキャー言ったり真剣に語ったり濃い時間を過ごしましたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀ちゃんは大人しそうだけど、ほんとはすっごく明るくて元気な子だし、\n笑い声がとにかく低くて面白いなって思ったり、沢山良いところ発見しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きぃちゃんも皆のことちゃんと考えてて......しっかりしてるなって...\nでもきぃちゃんはきぃちゃんだなって、ケラケラ笑うそのままのいいこでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい子って...まあやよりお姉ちゃんだから\n可愛いお姉ちゃんでした。(^w^)テヘペロ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また遊ぼうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(キャプテンれいかちゃんにCHUされたっ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGO!2もついに最終回になっちゃっいましたね......最終回はもう号泣しちゃいました......\n1ではドッキリや、全身にクリーム浴びせられたり、粉かぶったりと体はりました！\n2も色々な経験をしてなんだかんだ凄く楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MC イジリー岡田さんもベロをペロペロしたりするけどすっごく優しくて大好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組スタッフさんにも凄く凄く感謝してます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に有難う御座いましたm(__)mペコリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\n4月2日→気づいたら片想い発売日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月2日→総力特集広島東洋カープ2014の雑誌一人で頑張ったので是非見て欲しいですっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月4日→ミュージックドラゴン\n4月5日→MUSIC FAIR(２週続けて)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月7日→MUSIC JAPAN"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に出るので見てくださいっ\nなんか4、5、7日のは全部musicついてるねっ笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後１つ！朝日新聞さんで、埼玉の吹奏楽部に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃん、さゆにゃん、あしゅりん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の四人で訪問して、インタビューをしたり体験をさせてもらいましたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはトランペットでおいでシャンプー演奏しましたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ったので見てくだしゃい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またまた 大好きなマイマイ♪どこ見てるんだろう〜？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４月は自分の誕生日の月でもあるし、高校入学とかで期待と不安が入り交じる大切な月だな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４月から何か始めるよ！って方いますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よっし！がんばるぞっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/31/9554035/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"}],"source":"archive"}